Table as a block opener in a list item

```
- one
  |= H |
  | x |
.
<ul>
  <li>one
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">H</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>x</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- one
 |= H |
 | x |
.
<ul>
  <li>one
|= H |
| x |</li>
</ul>
```
